{
  "model": "ai-music-api/timeStamped-lyrics",
  "openapi": {
    "openapi": "3.1.0",
    "info": {
      "title": "kie.ai",
      "description": "kie.ai API 文档",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "contact": {
        "name": "技术支持",
        "email": "support@kie.ai"
      }
    },
    "tags": [],
    "paths": {
      "/api/v1/jobs/createTask": {
        "post": {
          "summary": "Get Timestamped Lyrics",
          "deprecated": false,
          "description": ":::warning Document updated\nIf you have already completed the integration process previously, you can still access the old version document at: Old version address (https://docs.kie.ai/old-model/suno-api/get-timestamped-lyrics)\n:::\nRetrieve synchronized lyrics with precise timestamps for music tracks.\n\n### Usage Guide\n- Use this endpoint to get lyrics that synchronize with audio playback\n- Implement karaoke-style lyric displays in your music players\n- Create visualizations that match audio timing\n\n### Parameter Details\n- Both `task_id` and `audio_id` are required to identify the specific track\n- The `task_id` comes from \"Generate Music\", \"Extend Music\" ,\"Upload-and-Cover\" or \"Upload-and-Extend\" endpoints\n- The `audio_id` identifies the specific track version when multiple were generated\n\n### Developer Notes\n- This endpoint returns the result synchronously. A request succeeds when both code and data.code are 200. If callBackUrl is set, a callback is also sent; its resultJson uses snake_case (aligned_words, start_s, end_s, p_align).\n- Timestamps are provided in seconds for precise synchronization\n- Waveform data is included for audio visualization implementations\n- For instrumental tracks (created with `instrumental=true`), no lyrics data will be returned",
          "operationId": "get-timestamped-lyrics",
          "tags": [],
          "parameters": [],
          "requestBody": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "required": [
                    "model",
                    "input"
                  ],
                  "properties": {
                    "model": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "The model name to use for generation. Required field.",
                      "examples": [
                        "ai-music-api/timeStamped-lyrics"
                      ]
                    },
                    "callBackUrl": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "The URL to receive generation task completion updates. Optional but recommended for production use.\n\n- System will POST task status and results to this URL when generation completes\n- Callback includes generated content URLs and task information\n- Your callback endpoint should accept POST requests with JSON payload containing results\n- Alternatively, poll GET /api/v1/jobs/recordInfo?taskId=... (see [Get Task Details](/market/common/get-task-detail)).\n- To ensure callback security, see [Webhook Verification Guide](/common-api/webhook-verification) for signature verification implementation",
                      "format": "uri"
                    },
                    "input": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "description": "Input parameters for the generation task",
                      "properties": {
                        "task_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Unique identifier of the music generation task. This should be a task_id returned from either the \"Generate Music\" or \"Extend Music\" endpoints.",
                          "examples": [
                            "5c79****be8e"
                          ]
                        },
                        "audio_id": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "description": "Unique identifier of the specific audio track for which to retrieve lyrics. This ID is returned in the callBackUrl data after music generation completes.",
                          "examples": [
                            "e231****-****-****-****-****8cadc7dc"
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "required": [
                        "task_id",
                        "audio_id"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                "example": {
                  "model": "ai-music-api/timeStamped-lyrics",
                  "callBackUrl": "https://api.example.com/callback",
                  "input": {
                    "task_id": "5c79****be8e",
                    "audio_id": "e231****-****-****-****-****8cadc7dc"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "required": true
          },
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "Request successful",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "allOf": [
                      {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "code": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "enum": [
                              200,
                              401,
                              404,
                              422,
                              429,
                              451,
                              455,
                              500
                            ],
                            "description": "Status code of the request. The HTTP status is 200 even when the request fails, so always check this field: 200 means success; any other value means the request failed and msg describes the reason. Common values: 401 invalid or missing API key; 402 insufficient credits; 429 rate limit exceeded; 422 or 500 the request could not be processed (read msg and check your parameters before retrying)."
                          },
                          "msg": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "Error message when code != 200",
                            "examples": [
                              "success"
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "data": {
                            "type": "object",
                            "properties": {
                              "code": {
                                "type": "integer",
                                "description": "Status code of the result. 200 means success.",
                                "examples": [
                                  200
                                ]
                              },
                              "msg": {
                                "type": "string",
                                "description": "Result message.",
                                "examples": [
                                  "success"
                                ]
                              },
                              "data": {
                                "type": "object",
                                "properties": {
                                  "alignedWords": {
                                    "type": "array",
                                    "description": "List of aligned lyrics words",
                                    "items": {
                                      "type": "object",
                                      "properties": {
                                        "word": {
                                          "type": "string",
                                          "description": "Lyrics word",
                                          "examples": [
                                            "[Verse]\nWaggin'"
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "success": {
                                          "type": "boolean",
                                          "description": "Whether lyrics word is successfully aligned",
                                          "examples": [
                                            true
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "startS": {
                                          "type": "number",
                                          "description": "Word start time (seconds)",
                                          "examples": [
                                            1.36
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "endS": {
                                          "type": "number",
                                          "description": "Word end time (seconds)",
                                          "examples": [
                                            1.79
                                          ]
                                        },
                                        "palign": {
                                          "type": "integer",
                                          "description": "Alignment parameter",
                                          "examples": [
                                            0
                                          ]
                                        }
                                      }
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "waveformData": {
                                    "type": "array",
                                    "description": "Waveform data, used for audio visualization",
                                    "items": {
                                      "type": "number"
                                    },
                                    "examples": [
                                      [
                                        0,
                                        1,
                                        0.5,
                                        0.75
                                      ]
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "hootCer": {
                                    "type": "number",
                                    "description": "Lyrics alignment accuracy score",
                                    "examples": [
                                      0.3803191489361702
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "isStreamed": {
                                    "type": "boolean",
                                    "description": "Whether it's streaming audio",
                                    "examples": [
                                      false
                                    ]
                                  }
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "example": {
                    "code": 200,
                    "msg": "success",
                    "data": {
                      "code": 200,
                      "msg": "success",
                      "data": {
                        "alignedWords": [
                          {
                            "word": "[Verse]\nWaggin'",
                            "success": true,
                            "startS": 1.36,
                            "endS": 1.79,
                            "palign": 0
                          }
                        ],
                        "waveformData": [
                          0,
                          1,
                          0.5,
                          0.75
                        ],
                        "hootCer": 0.3803191489361702,
                        "isStreamed": false
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "headers": {}
            },
            "500": {
              "$ref": "#/components/responses/Error",
              "description": "Server error."
            }
          },
          "security": [
            {
              "BearerAuth": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "webhooks": {},
    "components": {
      "schemas": {},
      "responses": {
        "Error": {
          "description": "Server error.",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "code": {
                    "type": "integer",
                    "description": "Response status code\n\n- **200**: Success - Request has been processed successfully\n- **401**: Unauthorized - Authentication credentials are missing or invalid\n- **402**: Insufficient Credits - Account does not have enough credits to perform the operation\n- **404**: Not Found - The requested resource or endpoint does not exist\n- **408**: Timeout - No result has been returned for over 10 minutes.\n- **422**: Validation Error - The request parameters failed validation checks\n- **429**: Rate Limited - Request limit has been exceeded for this resource\n- **455**: Service Unavailable - System is currently undergoing maintenance\n- **500**: Server Error - An unexpected error occurred while processing the request\n- **501**: Generation Failed - Content generation task failed\n- **505**: Feature Disabled - The requested feature is currently disabled"
                  },
                  "msg": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Response message, error description when failed"
                  },
                  "data": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {}
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "code",
                  "msg",
                  "data"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "Example 1": {
                  "summary": "Example 1",
                  "value": {
                    "code": 500,
                    "msg": "Server Error - An unexpected error occurred while processing the request"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "securitySchemes": {
        "BearerAuth": {
          "type": "http",
          "scheme": "bearer",
          "bearerFormat": "API Key",
          "description": "All API requests require a Bearer Token. Add the header `Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY` to authenticate requests."
        }
      }
    },
    "servers": [
      {
        "url": "https://api.kie.ai",
        "description": "正式环境"
      }
    ],
    "security": [
      {
        "BearerAuth": []
      }
    ]
  }
}
